ned","l":"Thumma `Abasa Wa Basara","w":[["thumma","Then"],["ʿabasa","he frowned"],["wabasara","and scowled"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","أَدۡبَرَ","وَٱسۡتَكۡبَرَ"],"t":"Then he turned back and was proud","l":"Thumma 'Adbara Wa Astakbara","w":[["thumma","Then"],["adbara","he turned back"],["wa-is'takbara","and was proud"]]},{"a":["فَقَالَ","إِنۡ","هَٰذَآ","إِلَّا","سِحۡرٞ","يُؤۡثَرُ"],"t":"And said, “This is nothing but magic from the past","l":"Faqala 'In Hadha 'Illa Sihrun Yu'utharu","w":[["faqāla","Then he said"],["in","Not"],["hādhā","(is) this"],["illā","but"],["siḥ'run","magic"],["yu'tharu","imitated"]]},{"a":["إِنۡ","هَٰذَآ","إِلَّا","قَوۡلُ","ٱلۡبَشَرِ"],"t":"This is nothing but the word of a mortal.”","l":"In Hadha 'Illa Qawlu Al-Bashari","w":[["in","Not"],["hādhā","(is) this"],["illā","but"],["qawlu","(the) word"],["l-bashari","(of) a human being"]]},{"a":["سَأُصۡلِيهِ","سَقَرَ"],"t":"I will roast him in Saqar","l":"Sa'uslihi Saqara","w":[["sa-uṣ'līhi","Soon I will drive him"],["saqara","(into) Hell"]]},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","سَقَرُ"],"t":"But what will explain to you what Saqar is","l":"Wa Ma 'Adraka Ma Saqaru","w":[["wamā","And what"],["adrāka","can make you know"],["mā","what"],["saqaru","(is) Hell"]]},{"a":["لَا","تُبۡقِي","وَلَا","تَذَرُ"],"t":"It neither leaves, nor spares","l":"La Tubqi Wa La Tadharu","w":[["lā","Not"],["tub'qī","it lets remain"],["walā","and not"],["tadharu","it leaves"]]},{"a":["لَوَّاحَةٞ","لِّلۡبَشَرِ"],"t":"It scorches the flesh","l":"Lawwahatun Lilbashari","w":[["lawwāḥatun","Scorching"],["lil'bashari","the human (skin)"]]},{"a":["عَلَيۡهَا","تِسۡعَةَ","عَشَرَ"],"t":"Over it are Nineteen","l":"Alayha Tis`ata `Ashara","w":[["ʿalayhā","Over it"],["tis'ʿata","(are) nine"],["ʿashara","teen"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","جَعَلۡنَآ","أَصۡحَٰبَ","ٱلنَّارِ","إِلَّا","مَلَـٰٓئِكَةٗۖ","وَمَا","جَعَلۡنَا","عِدَّتَهُمۡ","إِلَّا","فِتۡنَةٗ","لِّلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُواْ","لِيَسۡتَيۡقِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُواْ","ٱلۡكِتَٰبَ","وَيَزۡدَادَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَا